  "title": "Mid/Senior Fullstack Engineer",
  "url": "https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/biodock/jobs/8DqWTLa-mid-senior-fullstack-engineer",
  "description": "\u003ch2\u003eℹ️ \u003cstrong\u003eAbout the Position\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBiodock runs AI bioanalysis in the cloud, allowing scientists to accelerate R\u0026amp;D on the most promising new therapeutics. We are looking for talented full-stack web engineers to join our team and drive results for our customers and vision.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou'd build critical features from the ground up, and deliver fast without bureaucracy. We're looking for someone who is serious about building, and who can wear many hats.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOur stack\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeb (\u003cstrong\u003ethis role\u003c/strong\u003e): React, Apollo GraphQL, Typescript, Mongo, Node.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe also use: Docker, Terraform, Redis, AWS, Serverless. On our backend, closer to the Machine learning pipeline, we use Python, PyTorch and Numpy. Experience on these also highly desired.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e🔨 \u003cstrong\u003eWhat you'll do\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTake full ownership of our Biodock's full-stack web platform, all the way to deploys, infra, monitoring, debugging, and overall reliability.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWork on our modern web stack to build dynamic analysis methods in the cloud.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWork together with backend engineers to coordinate AI and image processing pipelines to work with our web application.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBe exposed to every level of the company, working closely with the other team members including executive team to meet business goals and working off customer feedback.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e🙋 \u003cstrong\u003eWho you are\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eYou’re a full-stack engineer with 4+ years of industry experience in a React/Typescript based stack with GraphQL/Apollo. People describe you as \"extremely productive.\"\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBig bonus points\u003c/strong\u003e for a great eye for design,\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFrontend - Great eye for design. Experience and enjoy using React Canvas, WebGL, Web Worker Threads. Experience in these highly desired.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBackend - Data modeling, especially in NoSQL/MongoDB.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eYou have experience in areas such as algorithms, databases, UX implementation, debugging, and full-stack performance measurement and optimization.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eYou have a strong background in computer science with a degree in CS or a related field.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eYou're flexible, trustworthy, energetic, and a great communicator.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e💰 \u003cstrong\u003ePay\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompetitive pay and equity\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n",
